      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "EUROPA (8) comes off an average run last start when fourth at this track over 340m behind Magic Ticket (19.92). Has winning claims on his best figures. ZIPPING SUTTON (2) had a tricky draw and ran well to finish second, beaten half a length, (19.73) at this track. Winning chance. QUEEN CANICULA (7) missed the frame last time when seventh (19.81) at this track in a Maiden but not beaten far the start prior. Good beginner but will need a little luck early crossing from on outside draw. Expected to do much better this time. STRIKE SWIFTLY (1) makes debut for the Peter Warner kennel. Drawn well and should get his chance. Profiles nicely but market best guide to ability.",
